# Workflow triggers

When the user asks to **build**, **run**, **launch**, **test**, **commit**, **push**, or **ship**, follow:

- **`xcode-workflow.mdc`** — Xcode CLI, destinations, build/deploy/test, warnings, Dre's Phone install+launch
- **`ship-workflow.mdc`** — changelog, app summary, user guide, commit message body, changelog reset on push

Apply these even when globs did not attach those rules to the current context.
